  ("h", "2-topshiriq (ampermetr rezistorga ketma-ket)"),
  "Avometr yordamida ampermetrning ichki qarshiligi \\(R_a\\) ni o‘lchang va zanjirni yig‘ing.",
  "Reostat qarshiligini o‘zgartirib, voltmetr \\(U\\) va ampermetr \\(I\\) ko‘rsatishlarini yozing.",
