 method=("FSMU va nostandart test", r"<p><b>FSMU:</b> “Toklarni hisoblash konturini aylanish yo‘nalishi qanday tanlanadi?” savoliga F — fikr, S — sabab, M — misol, U — umumlashtirish tartibida javob yozing.</p><p><b>Nostandart test (moslashtiring).</b> 1-guruh: (1) tok manbaining FIK; (2) Kirxgofning birinchi qoidasi; (3) tok zichligi; (4) EYuK; (5) butun zanjir uchun Om qonuni — va ta’riflar: (A) \(j=I/S=ne\upsilon\); (B) \(\mathcal E=A_{\text{chet}}/q\); (C) \(I=\mathcal E/(R+r)\); (D) tugundagi toklarning algebraik yig‘indisi nolga teng; (E) \(\eta=R/(R+r)\cdot100\%\).</p><p>2-guruh: (1) shunt; (2) Kirxgofning ikkinchi qoidasi; (3) qisqa tutashuv toki; (4) \(n\) ta elementni ketma-ket ulab batareya tuzish; (5) \(n\) ta elementni parallel ulab batareya tuzish — va ta’riflar: (A) \(\sum I_kR_k=\sum\mathcal E_k\); (B) \(I_{qt}=\mathcal E/r\); (C) \(r_{sh}=R/(n-1)\); (D) \(I=\mathcal E/(R+r/n)\) — ichki qarshilik \(n\) marta kamayadi; (E) \(I=n\mathcal E/(R+nr)\) — EYuK \(n\) marta ortadi.</p>"),
