 tbls=[("15.1-jadval. Faradey doimiysini aniqlash", ["№", "V (H₂), ml", "W, J", "U₀, V", "Q = W/U₀, Kl", "p, kPa", "T, K", "n = 2pV/(RT), mol", "F, Kl/mol", "ε, %"], 3)],
 calc=r"<p>Har bir tajriba uchun \(Q=W/U_0\), \(n=2pV/(RT)\) va \(F=Q/n\) hisoblanadi; o‘rtacha qiymat jadvaldagi \(F=96\,485\) Kl/mol bilan solishtiriladi. So‘ng elementar zaryad \(e=F/N_A\) (\(N_A=6{,}022\cdot10^{23}\) mol⁻¹) topiladi.</p><p>Nisbiy xatolik: \(\dfrac{\Delta F}{F}=\dfrac{\Delta W}{W}+\dfrac{\Delta U_0}{U_0}+\dfrac{\Delta V}{V}+\dfrac{\Delta p}{p}+\dfrac{\Delta T}{T}\). Sistematik xatolik manbalari: vodorodning qisman eruvchanligi, suv bug‘ining parsial bosimi, sathlar tengligining aniq ta’minlanmasligi.</p>",
